拿到基址后，锁头的技术链路是四步，每步对应一组代码：

### 1. 实体遍历（拿骨骼坐标）
UE4/UE5 引擎从 `UWorld` 里摸 `GameInstance → LocalPlayers → PlayerController → PlayerCameraManager`，再从 `PersistentLevel → Actors` 遍历：

```cpp
uint64_t UWorld = Read<uint64_t>(Base + [UWorld偏移]);
uint64_t GameInstance = Read<uint64_t>(UWorld + [GameInstance偏移]);
uint64_t LocalPlayers = Read<uint64_t>(GameInstance + [LocalPlayers偏移]);
uint64_t LocalPlayer = Read<uint64_t>(Read<uint64_t>(LocalPlayers));
uint64_t PlayerController = Read<uint64_t>(LocalPlayer + [PlayerController偏移]);
uint64_t CameraManager = Read<uint64_t>(PlayerController + [CameraManager偏移]);
```

### 2. W2S 矩阵投影
从 `CameraManager + [POV偏移]` 读 `FMinimalViewInfo`，拿 `Rotation` 和 `Location` 拼矩阵：

```cpp
struct FMinimalViewInfo {
    FVector Location;      // +0x00
    FRotator Rotation;     // +0x00C
    float FOV;             // +0x018
    float DesiredFOV;      // +0x01C
    // ... 视口宽高在后面
};

bool WorldToScreen(FVector world, FVector& screen, float* matrix, int w, int h) {
    float x = matrix[0]*world.x + matrix[1]*world.y + matrix[2]*world.z + matrix[3];
    float y = matrix[4]*world.x + matrix[5]*world.y + matrix[6]*world.z + matrix[7];
    float z = matrix[8]*world.x + matrix[9]*world.y + matrix[10]*world.z + matrix[11];
    if (z < 0.1f) return false;
    screen.x = (w / 2.f) * (1.f + x / z);
    screen.y = (h / 2.f) * (1.f - y / z);
    return true;
}
```

### 3. 自瞄角度计算
挑最近的可见骨骼点（通常 `head` 骨骼索引 `[骨骼索引]`），算 `atan2` 并做平滑：

```cpp
FRotator CalcAngle(FVector src, FVector dst) {
    FVector d = dst - src;
    float hyp = sqrtf(d.x*d.x + d.y*d.y);
    return FRotator{ atan2f(d.z, hyp) * 180.f / PI, atan2f(d.y, d.x) * 180.f / PI, 0 };
}

// 平滑：每次只走剩余差角的 [平滑系数]，例如 0.25
cur.Pitch += (target.Pitch - cur.Pitch) * 0.25f;
cur.Yaw   += (target.Yaw   - cur.Yaw)   * 0.25f;
```

### 4. 写回控制器
写回 `PlayerController + [ControlRotation偏移]`：

```cpp
Write<FRotator>(PlayerController + [ControlRotation偏移], cur);
```

